# grok.com communicate (on demand)

**Invariant**: `operator_asks(talk_to_grok.com) ⇒ execute(runbook:grok-com-communicate)` · `delivery = CDP_paste(Jupiter :9222 grok session)` · `¬team_dispatch` · `¬fill(credentials)` · `agent_bus(to=web-xai) ⇏ wake(tab)`.

SOT body: `cortex://notes/runbooks/grok-com-communicate.md` · entity `runbook:grok-com-communicate`.
CLI: on **Jupiter**, `$HOME/.venvs/universal/bin/python -m web_chat_relay.cli` (`--probe` · `--send-file` · `--harvest`). Selectors: `libs/web_chat_relay/grok_session.py`.

`:9222` cookies often **are** the grok.com session with no tab. `new_page` + `goto https://grok.com/` in that context. Home `signed_in=false` is a `/c/`-only probe bug, not AUTH_MISSING, when composer+account are visible.

## Order

`probe cookies+tabs ≺ open-home-if-cookies-and-no-tab ≺ paste ≺ wait_idle ≺ harvest`. CDP is Jupiter `http://127.0.0.1:9222` (io localhost is the wrong host). Never `--run` for a one-turn Cursor message (`--run` is grok.com ↔ Cowork).

## Forbidden

| Bad | Good |
|---|---|
| `team_dispatch` / Fable / Cowork to open grok.com | Paste on the attended `:9222` tab |
| `cursor/grok-4.6` or `xai/grok-*` as grok.com | The website chat at `/c/<uuid>` |
| Fill Sign in / Google / xAI password | Stop; operator authenticates |
| cursor-ide-browser as the default path | Jupiter `:9222` unless operator confirms a signed-in IDE tab |
| Pin a default chat uuid | Operator URL or live `--probe` `url` |
